<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Theory.</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we demonstrate that the m-tag (m&gt;1) system constitutes a universal Turing machine, following the construction presented in <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib47" title="" class="ltx_ref">47</a>]</cite>, with minor corrections.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Representation of a Turing Machine</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We begin by introducing the definition and step operation for the Turing Machine.
Consider a Turing Machine with a binary alphabet <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Gamma=\{0,1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Gamma=\{0,1\}</annotation></semantics></math>, where each state <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is defined by a quadruple <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(S_{i},D_{i},Q_{i0},Q_{i1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(S_{i},D_{i},Q_{i0},Q_{i1})</annotation></semantics></math>, corresponding to the transitions for the symbols 0 and 1.
A single step of the Turing Machine, when in state <math id="A1.SS1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, is performed as follows:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ol id="A1.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Write the symbol <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> onto the current tape cell.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Move the tape head one cell in direction <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{i}\in\{L,R\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{i}\in\{L,R\}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Read the symbol <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> from the cell currently.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Transition to the next state based on the symbol read <math id="A1.I1.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<ul id="A1.I1.i4.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{\prime}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{\prime}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, the next state is <math id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i0}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{\prime}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{\prime}=1</annotation></semantics></math>, the next state is <math id="A1.I1.i4.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">In this specific transition rule, the symbol written <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> and the tape head direction <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> are determined solely by the current state <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. The subsequent state transition depends on the symbol <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> read from the tape after the move: the machine transitions to state <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i0}</annotation></semantics></math> if <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{\prime}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{\prime}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, and to state <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i1}</annotation></semantics></math> if <math id="A1.SS1.p3.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S^{\prime}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>S</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S^{\prime}=1</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">An instantaneous description of the machine with state <math id="A1.SS1.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> at any given step is represented as:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\cdots a_{3}a_{2}a_{1}a_{0}\alpha b_{0}b_{1}b_{2}b_{3}\cdots" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">⋯</mo><mi>a</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>a</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>a</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>a</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>α</mi><mi>b</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>b</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>b</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>b</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>3</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em">⋯</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\cdots a_{3}a_{2}a_{1}a_{0}\alpha b_{0}b_{1}b_{2}b_{3}\cdots</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the state after reading <math id="A1.SS1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>. The complete instantaneous description can be described by a <span id="A1.SS1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">triplet</span>:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(Q,M,N)=(Q_{i},\sum_{i=0}^{\infty}a_{i}2^{i},\sum_{i=0}^{\infty}b_{i}2^{i})" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mrow><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">∞</mi></munderover><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></msup></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(Q,M,N)=(Q_{i},\sum_{i=0}^{\infty}a_{i}2^{i},\sum_{i=0}^{\infty}b_{i}2^{i})</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">where <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> is the string of symbols to the left of <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is the string of symbols to the right of <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>. The symbol <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> is the current symbol being read, which will soon be replaced by <math id="A1.SS1.p6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> depending on the transition rule.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p7" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p7.1" class="ltx_p">For a rightward movement, the next state <math id="A1.SS1.p7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> depends on the value of <math id="A1.SS1.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>. If <math id="A1.SS1.p7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}=0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}=0</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS1.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{\prime}=Q_{i0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{\prime}=Q_{i0}</annotation></semantics></math>, and if <math id="A1.SS1.p7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{i}=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{i}=1</annotation></semantics></math>, then <math id="A1.SS1.p7.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q^{\prime}=Q_{i1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q^{\prime}=Q_{i1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">The updating of the strings follows the rules:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M\leftarrow 2M+S_{i}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M\leftarrow 2M+S_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<table id="A1.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N\leftarrow\left\lfloor\frac{N}{2}\right\rfloor" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>⌊</mo><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N\leftarrow\left\lfloor\frac{N}{2}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">In the case of a rightward movement, only the values of <math id="A1.SS1.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>M</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.SS1.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> are swapped, due to the symmetry of the process. For the sake of simplicity, we assume here that the focus is on the rightward move, without loss of generality.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.2 </span>Equivalent Construction with a Tag System</h3>

<div id="A1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Given the instantaneous description of the Turing Machine as a triplet <math id="A1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(Q_{i},M,N)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(Q_{i},M,N)</annotation></semantics></math>, we can construct a corresponding string using the following form:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{i}x_{i}(\alpha_{i}x_{i})^{M}B_{i}x_{i}(\beta_{i}x_{i})^{N}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{i}x_{i}(\alpha_{i}x_{i})^{M}B_{i}x_{i}(\beta_{i}x_{i})^{N}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For simplicity and clarity, we will omit the subscript <math id="A1.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> in the notation and rewrite it as:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Ax(\alpha x)^{M}Bx(\beta x)^{N}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Ax(\alpha x)^{M}Bx(\beta x)^{N}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSSx1" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Step 0 (Initial)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A1.E4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Ax(\alpha x)^{M}Bx(\beta x)^{N}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Ax(\alpha x)^{M}Bx(\beta x)^{N}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(4)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Step 1</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rules:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A\rightarrow\begin{cases}Cx,&amp;\text{if }S=0\\
Cxcx,&amp;\text{if }S=1\end{cases},\quad\alpha\rightarrow cxcx" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A\rightarrow\begin{cases}Cx,&amp;\text{if }S=0\\
Cxcx,&amp;\text{if }S=1\end{cases},\quad\alpha\rightarrow cxcx</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Updated:</p>
<table id="A1.E5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Bx(\beta x)^{N}Cx(cx)^{M^{\prime}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Bx(\beta x)^{N}Cx(cx)^{M^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(5)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx2.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where</p>
<table id="A1.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="M^{\prime}=\begin{cases}2M,&amp;\text{if }S=0\\
2M+1,&amp;\text{if }S=1\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M^{\prime}=\begin{cases}2M,&amp;\text{if }S=0\\
2M+1,&amp;\text{if }S=1\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSSx3" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Step 2</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rules:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B\rightarrow S,\quad\beta\rightarrow s" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B\rightarrow S,\quad\beta\rightarrow s</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Updated:</p>
<table id="A1.E6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Cx(cx)^{M^{\prime}}S(s)^{N}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Cx(cx)^{M^{\prime}}S(s)^{N}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(6)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSSx4" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Step 3</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rules:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C\rightarrow D_{1}D_{0},\quad c\rightarrow d_{1}d_{0}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C\rightarrow D_{1}D_{0},\quad c\rightarrow d_{1}d_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Updated:</p>
<table id="A1.E7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S(s)^{N}D_{1}D_{0}(d_{1}d_{0})^{M^{\prime}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S(s)^{N}D_{1}D_{0}(d_{1}d_{0})^{M^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(7)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSSx5" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Step 4</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Rules:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S\rightarrow T_{1}T_{0},\quad s\rightarrow t_{1}t_{0}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S\rightarrow T_{1}T_{0},\quad s\rightarrow t_{1}t_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Based on the parity of <math id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math>, the updated string takes different forms:</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is odd:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{1}D_{0}(d_{1}d_{0})^{M^{\prime}}T_{1}T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N-1}{2}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{1}D_{0}(d_{1}d_{0})^{M^{\prime}}T_{1}T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N-1}{2}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p2.2" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.SS2.SSSx5.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is even:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{0}(d_{1}d_{0})^{M^{\prime}}T_{1}T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N}{2}}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{0}(d_{1}d_{0})^{M^{\prime}}T_{1}T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N}{2}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSSx6" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Step 5</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is odd:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{1}\rightarrow A_{1}x_{1},\quad d_{1}\rightarrow a_{1}x_{1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{1}\rightarrow A_{1}x_{1},\quad d_{1}\rightarrow a_{1}x_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Then, the resulting string is:</p>
<table id="A1.E8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{1}T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N-1}{2}}A_{1}x_{1}(\alpha_{1}x_{1})^{M^{\prime}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{1}T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N-1}{2}}A_{1}x_{1}(\alpha_{1}x_{1})^{M^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(8)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p2.1" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is even:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="D_{0}\rightarrow x_{0}A_{0}x_{0},\quad d_{0}\rightarrow a_{0}x_{0}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">D_{0}\rightarrow x_{0}A_{0}x_{0},\quad d_{0}\rightarrow a_{0}x_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx6.p2.2" class="ltx_p">Then, the resulting string is:</p>
<table id="A1.E9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N}{2}}x_{0}A_{0}x_{0}(\alpha_{0}x_{0})^{M^{\prime}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{0}(t_{1}t_{0})^{\frac{N}{2}}x_{0}A_{0}x_{0}(\alpha_{0}x_{0})^{M^{\prime}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(9)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SS2.SSSx7" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">Step 6 (Final)</h4>

<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is odd:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{1}\rightarrow B_{1}x_{1},\quad t_{1}\rightarrow\beta_{1}x_{1}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{1}\rightarrow B_{1}x_{1},\quad t_{1}\rightarrow\beta_{1}x_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Then,</p>
<table id="A1.E10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{1}x_{1}(\alpha_{1}x_{1})^{M^{\prime}}B_{1}x_{1}(\beta_{1}x_{1})^{\frac{N-1}{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{1}x_{1}(\alpha_{1}x_{1})^{M^{\prime}}B_{1}x_{1}(\beta_{1}x_{1})^{\frac{N-1}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p2.1" class="ltx_p">If <math id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> is even:</p>
<table id="A1.Ex17" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{0}\rightarrow B_{0}x_{0},\quad t_{0}\rightarrow\beta_{0}x_{0}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{0}\rightarrow B_{0}x_{0},\quad t_{0}\rightarrow\beta_{0}x_{0}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p2.2" class="ltx_p">Then,</p>
<table id="A1.E11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.E11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{0}x_{0}(\alpha_{0}x_{0})^{M^{\prime}}B_{0}x_{0}(\beta_{0}x_{0})^{\frac{N}{2}}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>M</mi><mo>′</mo></msup></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mfrac><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{0}x_{0}(\alpha_{0}x_{0})^{M^{\prime}}B_{0}x_{0}(\beta_{0}x_{0})^{\frac{N}{2}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.SS2.SSSx7.p2.3" class="ltx_p">This completes the proof that a single computation step of a Turing machine is successfully simulated by a sequence of transitions in the 2-tag system.</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Experiment Details</h2>

<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompt</h5>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We adopt the following 1-shot reasoning prompt template for evaluation, where the shot example is used to guide the output format extraction.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="849.16" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 849.16" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,849.16) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#003366;" fill="#003366" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 843.63 C 0 846.69 2.48 849.16 5.53 849.16 L 471.84 849.16 C 474.9 849.16 477.38 846.69 477.38 843.63 L 477.38 5.53 C 477.38 2.48 474.9 0 471.84 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DCE6F5;" fill="#DCE6F5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 5.53 L 1.38 843.63 C 1.38 845.92 3.24 847.78 5.53 847.78 L 471.84 847.78 C 474.13 847.78 475.99 845.92 475.99 843.63 L 475.99 5.53 C 475.99 3.24 474.13 1.38 471.84 1.38 L 5.53 1.38 C 3.24 1.38 1.38 3.24 1.38 5.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.62 14.31)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.98em;--ltx-fo-height:59.55em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="827.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 824)" width="428.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.98em;">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;|im_start|&gt;user 
<br class="ltx_break">Simulate a m-tag system. Your task is to simulate each transition step-by-step and provide the queue’s state at each step. Follow the rules and examples closely, and stop upon reaching the halt condition or 30 steps. Do not generate additional examples or new problems. No code.
</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">## Rules for Simulation:
<br class="ltx_break">1. In each transition, the machine performs the following steps:
<br class="ltx_break">  - If the queue length is less than m, halt
<br class="ltx_break">  - Read the head symbol of queue
<br class="ltx_break">  - Append symbols to the tail based on the head symbol and the corresponding transition rule
<br class="ltx_break">  - Delete m symbols from the head of the queue
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. The machine halt if:
<br class="ltx_break">  - The queue’s length is less than m.
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">## Example: 
<br class="ltx_break">m: 2
<br class="ltx_break">Alphabet: A, B, C 
<br class="ltx_break">Init: [B C A]
<br class="ltx_break">Transition rules:
<br class="ltx_break">A : C A C
<br class="ltx_break">B : A
<br class="ltx_break">C : B
<br class="ltx_break">Simulation steps:
<br class="ltx_break">### step 0:
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Init
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [B C A]
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">### step 1:
<br class="ltx_break">- Head Symbol: B
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Append A to the end of the queue. Remove B C from the head.
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [A A]
<br class="ltx_break">...
<br class="ltx_break">### step 4:
<br class="ltx_break">- Head Symbol: C
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Append B to the end of the queue. Remove C B from the head.
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [B] &lt;halt&gt;
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">---
</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">## The Only Problem to Solve:
<br class="ltx_break">m: {m}
<br class="ltx_break">Alphabet: {ALPHABET}
<br class="ltx_break">Init: {INIT}
<br class="ltx_break">Transition Rules:
<br class="ltx_break">{RULES}
<br class="ltx_break">Simulation steps:
<br class="ltx_break">&lt;|im_end|&gt;
</span></span>
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p2.pic1.1.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;|im_start|&gt;assistant
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Case</h5>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The response generated by Gemini-2.5-Pro, showcasing its impressive capabilities in instruction following and reasoning.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="779.29" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 779.29" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,779.29) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#003366;" fill="#003366" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.53 L 0 773.75 C 0 776.81 2.48 779.29 5.53 779.29 L 471.84 779.29 C 474.9 779.29 477.38 776.81 477.38 773.75 L 477.38 5.53 C 477.38 2.48 474.9 0 471.84 0 L 5.53 0 C 2.48 0 0 2.48 0 5.53 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#DCE6F5;" fill="#DCE6F5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.38 5.53 L 1.38 773.75 C 1.38 776.04 3.24 777.9 5.53 777.9 L 471.84 777.9 C 474.13 777.9 475.99 776.04 475.99 773.75 L 475.99 5.53 C 475.99 3.24 474.13 1.38 471.84 1.38 L 5.53 1.38 C 3.24 1.38 1.38 3.24 1.38 5.53 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 13.62 10.86)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.98em;--ltx-fo-height:54.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="757.58" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 757.58)" width="428.68"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.98em;">
<span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;|im_start|&gt;assistant
<br class="ltx_break">Here is the step-by-step simulation:
<br class="ltx_break">m: 2
<br class="ltx_break">Alphabet: A, B, C, D, E
<br class="ltx_break">Init: [B D D]
<br class="ltx_break">Transition Rules:
<br class="ltx_break">A : C
<br class="ltx_break">B : E C E C
<br class="ltx_break">C : B B B A
<br class="ltx_break">D : D B B
<br class="ltx_break">E : A E E E
<br class="ltx_break">Simulation steps:
<br class="ltx_break">### step 0:
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Init
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [B D D]
<br class="ltx_break">### step 1:
<br class="ltx_break">- Head Symbol: B
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Append E C E C to the end of the queue. Remove B D from the head.
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [D E C E C]
<br class="ltx_break">### step 2:
<br class="ltx_break">- Head Symbol: D
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Append D B B to the end of the queue. Remove D E from the head.
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [C E C D B B]
<br class="ltx_break">...
<br class="ltx_break">### step 18:
<br class="ltx_break">- Head Symbol: E
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Append A E E E to the end of the queue. Remove E C from the head.
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [E C A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E]
<br class="ltx_break">### step 19:
<br class="ltx_break">- Head Symbol: E
<br class="ltx_break">- Action: Append A E E E to the end of the queue. Remove E C from the head.
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">_ _ _ _</span>] (Answer)
<br class="ltx_break">- Queue State: [A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E A E E E <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.pic1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">A E E E</span>] (Ground Truth)
<br class="ltx_break">...
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
</section>
